# Only pyproject.toml, uv.lock, app/, contracts/, policy/, personas/, prompts/ and pipelines/ are
# ever needed to build the backend image (see the Dockerfile); everything else here is excluded
# so it can never leak into a layer, intentionally or not.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!app/
!contracts/
!policy/
!personas/
!prompts/
!pipelines/
